# Keep the Docker build context small and — more importantly — never bake local
# secrets or throwaway state into an image layer. Only /proto, /relay, /daemon,
# and /docker are needed by the dev-fleet builds; everything else is excluded.
#
# This file affects `docker build` / `docker compose build` only. It has no
# effect on the Go/Rust/proto toolchains or on CI (CI never invokes Docker).

# VCS + tooling metadata
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.dev-loop/
scripts/dev-loop/

# Docs are not needed to compile the binaries (the dev-fleet doc lives in-repo,
# not in the image).
docs/

# Build outputs — rebuilt inside the multi-stage images, never copied from host.
daemon/target/
relay/bin/

# Local Relay state / SQLite store (never bake a laptop's store into an image).
**/relay-data/
**/ca-data/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite

# Never bake key material or certificates into an image.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.csr
